# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": any line may use any name the block binds, and the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else) and Type System ch. 2: loud gives 10, so the label reads "11" and the arm's label is 2; soft gives 20 and builds nothing in its arm. Never run: prismc refuses the program.
test loud

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    1: Ui.Label(text="11")
    2: Ui.Label(text="loud")

test soft

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    1: Ui.Label(text="21")
